(
    title: "Frankenstein\'s Monster",
    description: Some("To keep Dr. Frankenstein\'s monster from waking, the player hauls bricks up from the castle dungeon — six loads in all — to wall the creature in before a rising electrical storm charges the Power Probe that would animate it. Acid pits, spiders and bats harry the climb; fail to finish the barricade in time and the monster tears free, lurching forward until it fills the screen."),
